    "detailed_description": "What better way to spend some free time than with Milk and Cookies?<br />\r\nHave fun going through amazing levels, cute graphics, different doors and environments. New puzzle challenges await at every step of the way. Even enemies! Find a way to beat Little Jhonny and Angry Bob. Your main goal is to reunite milk and cookies of course :3<br />\r\nIf you like physics and yummy snacks, then this is a game for you.<br />\r\nWe all know they\u2019re made for each other, so help them get back together :D<br />\r\nThe gameplay is addictive, dynamic and satisfying.<br />\r\nThere are also a lot of characters to unlock! <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the upcoming updates, we will include new doors, levels, and a shop of endless customization fun.<br />\r\nThe sandbox door will also be available, and you will be able to create your own levels for others and yourself to play!<br />\r\nCompete with others, see who can get a higher score!",
